y moment,,,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_12","text":"Okay then, guess.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_13","text":"Hehe,,he,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_14","text":"Now I shall, show you my, incredible powers of, deduction,,,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_15","text":"Let's ssseeee...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_16","text":"I've got it!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_17","text":"You're sitting, back and, enjoying some, leisure time, resting,,,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_18","text":"Amm I right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_19","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_20","text":"Darn,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_21","text":"A minor, hiccupp, notthing more,!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_22","text":"I'll get it, this time for, sure,,.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_23","text":"Watson, you are...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_novel_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_novel_04_24","text":"in the, simullation room, no?","jump":null},{"id